node_modules/
dist/
# The eye-test bench, in full. Ignored rather than partially ignored because
# shiki reads ANY non-authoring entry of `git status` as implementation in
# flight, so an untracked `sandbox/` gates every contract written here the
# moment it lands on disk. Whether the bench should live outside the repo
# altogether, with its recipe versioned, is still open.
sandbox/
# Session state (mode locks, gate baselines, run results), never a contract.
# Globbed, not anchored: shiki resolves `.tayomi/` from the directory it is
# handed, so any folder a gate ever ran in acquires one holding nothing else.
**/.tayomi/state/
